bottomparticipants

actor User
boundary "Profile Page" as UI
boundary Router
control AuthController
control AuthService
entity UserModel
database MongoDB

User -> UI: 1. Click Avatar
activate User
activate UI

UI -> Router: 2. GET /api/auth/me (cookie)
activate Router

loop Invalid token / expired token / Invalid role
  Router --> UI: 2.1. Show error
  UI --> User: 2.2. Cannot load profile
end 

Router -> AuthController: 3. getMe(req)
activate AuthController
AuthController -> AuthService: 4. getMe(req)
activate AuthService

AuthService -> UserModel: 5. findById(req.user.user_id)
activate UserModel
UserModel -> MongoDB: 6. user / null
activate MongoDB
MongoDB --> UserModel: 7. user / null
deactivate MongoDB
UserModel --> AuthService: 8. user / null
deactivate UserModel

opt User not found
  AuthService --> AuthController: 8.1. UnauthorizedException
  AuthController --> Router: 8.2. HTTP response
  Router --> UI: 8.3. Show error
  UI --> User: 8.4. Cannot load profile
end
  
AuthService --> AuthController: 9. Profile data

deactivate AuthService

AuthController --> Router: 10. HTTP response
deactivate AuthController
Router --> UI: 11. Render profile / show error
deactivate Router
UI --> User: 12. Show profile
deactivate UI
deactivate User